                            <p>
                                <b>Note:</b>
                                <br/>
                                Original form to be filed in the personal file with a copy of the same updated in GPM
                                Separation task.
                            </p>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <h4>
                                <u>Exit Interview Form</u>
                            </h4>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Name:</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.employee_id.name"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Employee Code:</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.employee_code"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Department</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.department_id.name"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Designation</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.designation_id.name"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Date of Joining:</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.date_of_joining"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Date of Exit:</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.date_of_exit"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Personal
                                            Email ID:
                                        </b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.email"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Mob #:</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="doc.mobile"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>

                            </table>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <span>The objective of this questionnaire is to elicit your honest feedback using which the
                                organization can learn from its shortcomings. All information provided by you will be
                                kept
                                confidential and used only for the purpose of organizational improvement.
                            </span>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <b>Reasons for separation</b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px; ">
                                        <t t-esc="dict(doc._fields['reason_for_separation'].selection).get(doc.reason_for_separation, '')"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>

                            <!--                            <table align="right"-->
                            <!--                                   style="width: 50%; border-collapse: collapse;  font-size: 14px; ">-->
                            <!--                                <tr>-->
                            <!--                                    <th style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px;">Solis/HR/PROCESS-->
                            <!--                                        /7.5-->
                            <!--                                    </th>-->
                            <!--                                    <th style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px;">Separation Process-->
                            <!--                                    </th>-->
                            <!--                                </tr>-->
                            <!--                                <tr>-->
                            <!--                                    <td style="text-align: center;  padding: 10px;">Solis/HR/SP/Exit interview Form/1.1-->
                            <!--                                    </td>-->
                            <!--                                    <td style="text-align: center;  padding: 10px;">Exit interview Form</td>-->
                            <!--                                </tr>-->

                            <!--                            </table>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->

                            <!--                            <div style="align-item:center;margin-left:250px;">-->
                            <!--                                <img t-if="res_company.logo" t-att-src="image_data_uri(res_company.logo)" alt="Logo"-->
                            <!--                                     style="width:50%;height:75px;  "/>-->
                            <!--                            </div>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->
                            <!--                            <br/>-->
                            <b>Kindly elaborate the reasons:</b>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <ol>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Reason for looking for a Job Outside?</b>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.reason_for_looking_job"/>
                                    <br/>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Did you inform your superior/HR Manager that you were planning to leave?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border:1px solid white;">
                                        <td>
                                            <t t-esc="dict(doc._fields['inform_manager'].selection).get(doc.inform_manager, '')"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </table>
                                    <br/>
                                    <span>
                                        <b>If yes, what was the response?</b>
                                    </span>
                                    <br/>
                                    <td>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.inform_manager_reason"/>
                                    </td>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Did they make any efforts to retain you?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border:1px solid white;">
                                        <td>
                                            <t t-esc="dict(doc._fields['retain_effort'].selection).get(doc.retain_effort, '')"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </table>
                                    <br/>
                                    <span>
                                        <b>If yes, what was the response?</b>
                                    </span>
                                    <br/>
                                    <td>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.retain_effort_response"/>
                                    </td>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>When you joined, did you feel the following were satisfactorily explained to
                                        you?
                                    </b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <ol type="a">
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Company Policies :</b>
                                            <td></td>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.company_policies_explained"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Rules &amp; Regulations :</b>
                                            <td></td>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.rules_regulations_explained"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Entitlements &amp; Benefits :</b>
                                            <td></td>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.entitlements_benefits_explained"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Nature of work :</b>
                                            <td></td>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.nature_of_work_explained"/>
                                        </li>
                                    </ol>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Do you like the work you were doing?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.work_like"/>
                                    <br/>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>How do you feel about the following?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <ol type="a">
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Your career progress with the company :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.career_progress_feedback"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Training and Development inputs received by you :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.training_development_feedback"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Compensation policy &amp; levels in the company :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.compensation_policy_feedback"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>HR Policies and Systems :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.hr_policies_feedback"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>

                                    </ol>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>What are your suggestions to improve:</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <ol type="a">
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>The work you were doing :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.suggestions_work_improvement"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>Training &amp; Development activities :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.suggestions_training_improvement"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>H.R. policies and systems :</b>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.suggestions_hr_improvement"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                    </ol>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>How was the working environment?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <ol type="a">
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>In the company :</b>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.working_environment_company"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>In the department:</b>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.working_environment_department"/>
                                        </li>
                                    </ol>

                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>How do you feel about the communication channels in the company – Were you
                                        briefed from
                                        time to time regarding the development pertaining the organisation – changes in
                                        policies, rules &amp; regulations?
                                    </b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.communication_feedback"/>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Were the higher authorities easily approachable? How do you feel about the
                                        communication
                                        within your department?
                                    </b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.approachability_feedback"/>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Do you get along with your superior? Was he helpful and accessible? How did he
                                        handle
                                        grievances / complaints?
                                    </b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.superior_feedback"/>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Did you enjoy working with your colleagues? Were they helpful?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.colleagues_feedback"/>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Any suggestion to improvement?</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.colleagues_improvement"/>
                                </li>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>How do you feel regarding the co-ordination between your department and other
                                        departments? Any suggestions for improvement?
                                    </b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.coordination_feedback"/>
                                </li>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>How were</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <ol type="a">
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>The welfare activities :</b>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.welfare_activities_feedback"/>
                                        </li>
                                        <br/>
                                        <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                            <b>The staff facilities:</b>
                                            <t t-esc="doc.staff_facilities_feedback"/>
                                        </li>
                                    </ol>
                                </li>
                                <br/>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Your suggestions for improvement</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.suggestions"/>
                                </li>
                                <li style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                                    <b>Do you have any suggestions in general to make this company a better organisation
                                        to
                                        work for &amp; for the benefit of other colleagues?
                                    </b>
                                    <br/>
                                    <br/>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.general_suggestions"/>
                                </li>

                            </ol>


                            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border:1px solid white;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>
                                            <b>New Employment Details:</b>
                                        </b>

                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Organisation:</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.new_employment_organization"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Designation:</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.new_employment_designation"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Compensation Package:
                                            (Monthly):
                                        </b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.new_employment_compensation_monthly"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>(Annual)</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.new_employment_compensation_annual"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Working Conditions
                                            :
                                        </b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.new_employment_working_conditions"/>
                                    </td>

                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Other Details
                                            :
                                        </b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.other_details"/>
                                    </td>

                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;"></td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;"></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Signature of Employee:</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.signature_employee.name"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Exit interview conducted by:</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.conducted_by"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Signature:</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.conducted_by_signature.name"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left;  padding: 10px;">
                                        <b>Date:</b>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.interview_date"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <div style="page-break-before: always;"></div>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            This section of the Form needs to be filled immediately after the exit interview.
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <b>
                                <b>Comments by the H.O.D.:</b>
                            </b>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            (Kindly discuss the contents with the immediate supervisor. Yours &amp; the supervisor’s
                            responses to be recorded. Form to be sent to the General Manager/ BU Head within two days
                            from the date of receipt)
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <b>
                                <b>Supervisor’s response:</b>
                            </b>
                            <br/>
                            <t t-esc="doc.supervisor_response"/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <b>
                                <b>HODs comments:</b>
                            </b>
                            <br/>
                            <t t-esc="doc.hod_comments"/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <div style="text-align:right;">
                                <div>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.hod_signature.name"/>
                                </div>
                                <div style="border-top:1px solid black; display:inline-block; margin-top:5px; width:200px;">
                                    <b>Signature of the HOD</b>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <br/>
                            <div>
                                <text>
                                    <b>Comments by the General Manager/ BU Head:</b>
                                    <br/>
                                    (Kindly record your comments &amp; forward the form to the H.R. Manager after
                                    discussing with the concerned H.O.D.)
                                    <div>
                                        <t t-esc="doc.gm_comments"/>
                                    </div>
                                </text>
                            </div>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <div style="text-align:right;">
                                <div>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.gm_signature.name"/>
                                </div>
                                <div style="border-top:1px solid black; display:inline-block; margin-top:5px; width:200px;">
                                    <b>Signature of the GM/BU Head</b>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <br/>
                            <br/>
                            <div style="text-align:left;">
                                <text>
                                    <b>Received by HRD (Date):</b>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.hr_received_date"/>
                                </text>
                            </div>
                            <br/>
                            <div style="text-align:right;">
                                <div>
                                    <t t-esc="doc.hr_signature.name"/>
                                </div>
                                <div style="border-top:1px solid black; display:inline-block; margin-top:5px; width:200px;">
                                    <b>Signature of the HR Responsible</b>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <br/>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>
